- op: discuss  # 49b0
  at: '2026-05-18T06:30:07Z'  # 49b0
  by: agent  # 49b0
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 49b0
  clock: 5  # 49b0
  nonce: 49b0  # 49b0
  message: "Closed as side effect of INV-tofur (PR #3789). The root cause was sketch_embeddings._get_repo_state_hash using path:size:mtime for its non-git cache shard key, which picked up tracker .ops mtime jitter. The function now delegates to compute_repo_fingerprint, which uses content hashing — mtime changes no longer affect the cache key. Existing cache entries become unreachable on the algorithm switch (one-time miss, absorbed naturally as the cache repopulates under the new key). Verified by the existing test_state_hash_changes_with_file_modifications + new test_mtime_only_change_does_not_change_fingerprint property tests."  # 49b0
